     4234       input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     4235       run fltfield-add in this-procedure('pl-code', 'Код-места', '',
     4236       input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     4237       Filter-Block:
     4238       DO ON STOP    UNDO Filter-Block, LEAVE Filter-Block
     4239           ON ERROR   UNDO Filter-Block, LEAVE Filter-Block
     4240           ON END-KEY UNDO Filter-Block, LEAVE Filter-Block :
     4241         run gbl/filter.w ( INPUT parparentproc
     4242                          , INPUT (filter-point + chr(4) + filter-label)
